			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 412120601,
					"content": "前面沒有路了，只有一個很大的山洞入口。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120602,
					"content": "是跑進去了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120603
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412120603,
					"content": "從腳印的情況來看，它跑進去了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120604,
					"content": "那我們也跟上去吧！不要讓它跑遠了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120605,
					"content": "等等。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120606,
					"content": "這座雪山體積驚人，山腹內就算有路，也不會是一馬平川的那種。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120607,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120608,
					"content": "感覺到了嗎？帶著冰原和山石氣味的風…還有回聲，裡面的空間一定很大。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120609,
					"content": "還真是！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120610,
					"content": "所以，輕舉妄動對我們沒有好處。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120611,
					"content": "可是…都已經追到這裡了，總不能讓它白白跑掉吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120612,
					"content": "那本素描本對你很重要吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120613
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 412120613,
					"content": "很重要，但也不能莽撞行事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120614,
					"content": "還有另一條路，只是要費些功夫。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120615,
					"content": "沒猜錯的話，這個山洞的出口在山體另一側。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						412120616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				},
				{
					"id": 412120616,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}很擅長飛行，我的技術也還不錯。做好準備吧，我們一口氣飛過去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "阿貝多"
				}
			]
		},
